OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans gather ahead of
OL,4,Atwo-minute silence at Remembrance
OL,5,ASunday service
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe King is due to lead the nation in a
OL,8,Ftwo-minute silence at the Cenotaph in
OL,9,Fcentral London to mark Remembrance
OL,10,FSunday - watch BBC One's special
OL,11,Fcoverage above
OL,13,FHe will lay a wreath at the memorial to
OL,14,Fremember those who died - what does the
OL,15,Fservice entail?
OL,17,FVeterans have gathered in large crowds
OL,18,Fand are lining up around the Cenotaph -
OL,19,Fwhy the monument is significant
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
