OL,3,GNEWSAVeterans gather ahead of
OL,4,Atwo-minute silence at Remembrance
OL,5,ASunday service
OL,6,
OL,7,FSome 10,000 armed forces veterans will
OL,8,Ftake part in the Royal British Legion's
OL,9,Fmarch-past through Whitehall, alongside
OL,10,Fabout 20 World War Two veterans
OL,12,F"I think it will be a very emotional
OL,13,Fday," says 103-year-old Annie Duplock,
OL,14,Fwho was a Land Girl during WW2
OL,16,FAndy Burnham will be joined by former
OL,17,FPMs including Boris Johnson, Tony Blair
OL,18,Fand John Major
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
